  "description": "“I'm a fan, but I don't want to be discovered!”\n\nSeo Seungah, who is an Otaku obsessed more than anyone else but completely hides and lives a perfectionist life, Ha Yeonwoo, a boy who appeared in front of her and took her to an otaku club.\n\nA delicious romance that starts with the otaku club.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=799226), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=8785402)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[Japanese](https://manga.line.me/product/periodic?id=Z0002826)",
